Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.27,0:00:22.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Arusnya berubah?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.56,0:00:25.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Tiba-tiba,\Nkita tidak bisa menangkap ikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.19,0:00:27.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang kita dapatkan hanyalah...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.48,0:00:29.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial! Itu terjadi lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.94,0:00:32.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tersangkut di jala!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.66,0:00:40.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia di dasar laut sekarang?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.70,0:00:42.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang benar saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah menemukan kuil Shiranui,\NTuan Kamon?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.67,0:00:52.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.71,0:00:55.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi karena ada di bawah sana,\Ntidak banyak yang bisa kita lakukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.68,0:00:59.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau berniat membunuh Shiranui, Tuan Kamon?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.35,0:01:01.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tergantung.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.81,0:01:03.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang direncanakan
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.73,0:01:06.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shiranui berengsek itu sekarang?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.11,0:01:10.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita akan melakukan ritual pemanggilan roh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.28,0:01:12.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.66,0:01:20.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami memanggil jiwa\Nyang tinggal di dalam rambut ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.95,0:01:22.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Datanglah, dengan titah suci!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.94,0:01:48.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.42,0:02:11.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malam itu, Masago memintaku keluar
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.17,0:02:13.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menunggunya di gubuk di Pantai Utara.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.09,0:02:17.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi dia tidak datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.43,0:02:21.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika rambut Masago berasal\Ndari kuil Shiranui,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.01,0:02:23.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,itu berarti...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.72,0:02:25.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.39,0:02:30.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita harus mendapatkan kebenaran\Ndari Shiranui.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.90,0:02:35.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Shiranui,\Nrambutnya telah menembus penghalang.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.78,0:02:39.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin saja memindahkan kuil dari Kyoto
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.45,0:02:41.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,telah membahayakan penghalangnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.62,0:02:44.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.99,0:02:47.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,tak ada yang lebih menakutkan
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.46,0:02:50.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,daripada kegigihan seorang wanita.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.88,0:02:54.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan begitu, Masago?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.18,0:03:08.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo kembali, Kamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.44,0:03:16.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon berusaha keras.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.23,0:03:17.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.15,0:03:20.08,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Dia mungkin berusaha\Nmenghancurkan penghalang kuil
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.11,0:03:21.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,dengan energi Kayu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.62,0:03:24.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Masago
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.20,0:03:27.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,sangat cantik.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.12,0:03:32.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa jiwanya
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.38,0:03:35.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,di dalam kuil?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.71,0:03:38.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.22,0:03:42.18,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,ada orang merepotkan di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.93,0:03:44.43,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Natsuno?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.10,0:03:47.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.35,0:03:49.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.64,0:03:51.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau gadis yang bersama Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.65,0:03:59.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.82,0:04:02.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maumu, Mao?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.20,0:04:05.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau memanggilku kemari\Ndengan jimat kupu-kupu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.78,0:04:08.08,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kami ingin meminta bantuanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.37,0:04:12.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.87,0:04:15.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau ingin pergi ke kuil di dasar laut?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.96,0:04:16.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.96,0:04:18.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi pertama-tama, Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.63,0:04:25.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa menurutmu ide bagus mempertemukan\Npara penyintas Goshikido semudah itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.35,0:04:29.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga. Ada aturan
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.52,0:04:32.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,bahwa mereka yang dipanggil ke Goshikido\Nharus saling membunuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.02,0:04:33.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.23,0:04:37.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,ingin kita semua saling membunuh, Natsuno?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.61,0:04:40.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa yang tahu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.53,0:04:44.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, Kamon, kau yang butuh bantuanku?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.36,0:04:46.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.78,0:04:49.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno, aku tak mengira kau masih hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kau yakin ini tak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, karena itu aku memintanya datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.42,0:04:57.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi ini pertaruhan besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.96,0:05:00.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setidaknya Natsuno
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.05,0:05:04.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak pernah tertarik\Ndengan suksesi Klan Goko.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.22,0:05:08.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan membantumu, Kamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.31,0:05:14.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi sebagai balasannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.85,0:05:18.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,jangan campuri urusanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.25,0:05:41.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Luar biasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.25,0:05:44.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengesankan, Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.17,0:05:47.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu,\Nkita akan menyelam menggunakan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.76,0:05:50.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi akan sulit
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.47,0:05:53.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,menjaga boneka tanah liat ini\Ntetap utuh di bawah laut.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.18,0:05:55.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, di situlah
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.93,0:05:56.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,peranmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.19,0:05:58.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.81,0:06:01.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau dari elemen Tanah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.82,0:06:02.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bantu aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.73,0:06:06.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu... Apa yang harus kulakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.24,0:06:07.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tak berencana membawa Nanoka\Nke dalam air.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku berniat memintanya menunggu di pantai.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.83,0:06:15.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia benar, ini terlalu berbahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.00,0:06:19.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shiranui akan melawan\Ndan Mao takkan bisa tetap fokus.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.25,0:06:23.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena kau akan mengkhawatirkanku?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.38,0:06:26.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja. Ini masalah hidup dan mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.26,0:06:29.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Haruskah kita menyerah saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.38,0:06:30.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak! Aku akan melakukannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.97,0:06:31.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya, masuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.12,0:08:23.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka dan aku akan terus menyalurkan\Nenergi kami ke boneka tanah liat.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.04,0:08:26.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Tunjukkan tanganmu.\N- Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.25,0:08:32.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan tasbih ini,\Nenergi kita akan menjadi satu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.26,0:08:34.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tiru segel tanganku.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.64,0:08:36.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.10,0:08:38.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yin Agung, sumber semua kehidupan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.89,0:08:40.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Roh air.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.14,0:08:42.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jawablah Kehampaan dan Bintang Utara.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.10,0:08:44.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kura-kura dan Ular, bersatu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.94,0:08:46.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melintasi Enam Arah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.19,0:08:48.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Buat semua roh kagum.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.53,0:08:51.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan biarkan apa pun tetap tak terlihat.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan biarkan sumpah tidak terpenuhi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari akhir zaman ke zaman berikutnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.03,0:08:57.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.20,0:09:00.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno sangat kooperatif, bukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.33,0:09:05.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak memercayai Nona Natsuno, bukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.17,0:09:10.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk saat ini, aku akan bersyukur saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.77,0:09:29.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penghalangnya menahan kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan cepat, sesuai perintah hukum.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.44,0:09:35.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semoga sumpah suci ini terpenuhi.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.20,0:09:42.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita sudah menembusnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat hitam?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.47,0:09:59.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.01,0:10:02.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia mungkin mengulur waktu untuk kabur.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.51,0:10:03.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia tidak akan lolos!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.37,0:10:21.45,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Mao,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.83,0:10:24.75,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,tak kuduga kau akan mendatangiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.83,0:10:27.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurasa
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau ikut dengan Kamon hari ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.08,0:10:34.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, kau tahu alasan kami datang, Shiranui.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.05,0:10:38.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang kau lakukan kepada Masago?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.55,0:10:42.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu rambut itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.89,0:10:44.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Merepotkan sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.72,0:10:48.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bersusah payah\Nmemindahkan kuilku ke sini,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.94,0:10:52.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi aku tak pernah mengantisipasi\Nrambut Masago
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.48,0:10:55.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,menembus penghalang.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.49,0:10:59.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, ini bukan jebakan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.66,0:11:02.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Roh yang kami panggil dari rambut itu
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.91,0:11:04.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,bukan dari orang hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.04,0:11:07.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana Masago?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.08,0:11:10.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja dia sudah mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.38,0:11:14.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sudah mati selama 900 tahun.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau membunuhnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.19,0:11:25.67,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Shiranui.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.68,0:11:27.31,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Awasi Masago.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.48,0:11:30.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Guru?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.60,0:11:33.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maksudmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.28,0:11:39.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan biarkan dia kabur dari kediaman ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.24,0:11:49.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga tahu Masago membenci Klan Goko.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.08,0:11:51.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terutama
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.96,0:11:54.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,setelah Daigo dikutuk sampai mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.55,0:11:58.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, malam itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.30,0:12:00.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Masago!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.05,0:12:02.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Masago!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.51,0:12:04.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mau ke mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shiranui...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.85,0:12:09.85,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Berpura-puralah tidak tahu, Shiranui.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.77,0:12:13.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak berniat kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.94,0:12:15.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Kenapa kau melakukan ini?\N- Aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.73,0:12:19.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,dipanggil ke Goshikido.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.91,0:12:26.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, ternyata Masago yang dipanggil.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.58,0:12:30.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi dia mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.25,0:12:35.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago memberitahuku\Napa yang terjadi di Goshikido.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.34,0:12:37.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bahkan memberitahuku kau tumbalnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.51,0:12:48.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu mereka menyuruhku membunuh penyihir\Nyang belum pernah kutemui.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.10,0:12:49.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.56,0:12:52.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tak bisa melakukan hal seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.41,0:13:06.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Masago...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.20,0:13:09.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Masago!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.45,0:13:10.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Masago!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.66,0:13:16.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat Masago mati,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.96,0:13:20.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,ayakashi mulai mengerumuniku.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.97,0:13:25.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kutuk Mao sampai mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.39,0:13:28.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kau tidak punya tekad\Nuntuk melakukan itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.26,0:13:30.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,maka matilah di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.68,0:13:35.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kukira mereka akan membunuhku,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.56,0:13:38.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi di sinilah aku, masih hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, bukannya Masago,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.23,0:13:43.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau menggantikannya di lingkaran Goshikido?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.74,0:13:47.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katakan, Kamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.74,0:13:52.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga tak ada di kediaman malam itu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.91,0:13:57.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau berencana kabur bersama Masago?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.13,0:13:59.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,berencana kabur denganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.46,0:14:06.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika begitu, Masago mati karenamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.93,0:14:10.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, sudah waktunya
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.18,0:14:13.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.90,0:14:23.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, sudah waktunya kau mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.04,0:14:39.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao, kau ikut denganku.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.09,0:14:44.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat hitam lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.55,0:14:48.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak berasal dari Shiranui.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.68,0:14:51.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu berasal dari belakangnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.14,0:14:56.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.89,0:14:58.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tidak membutuhkanmu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.94,0:15:02.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Koral?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.23,0:15:06.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini terlalu keras!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.86,0:15:08.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.41,0:15:16.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak bisa bernapas.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.33,0:15:22.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.71,0:15:28.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kukira Masago satu-satunya penyihir Air
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.67,0:15:30.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang dipanggil ke Goshikido.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.68,0:15:33.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu sebabnya hari itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.26,0:15:35.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.89,0:15:40.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malam ini. Di tempat biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.77,0:15:49.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika dia tahu\Naku juga dipanggil ke Goshikido,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.24,0:15:51.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,apa yang akan Masago lakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.49,0:15:58.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di kediaman, satu demi satu orang\Ndikutuk sampai mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.62,0:16:01.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka yang dipanggil ke Goshikido
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.87,0:16:05.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,tahu apa artinya,\Njadi mereka bersiap, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.84,0:16:14.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayolah. Siapa yang melakukan itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.47,0:16:22.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin aku harus pergi\Ndari kediaman ini sekarang
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.48,0:16:24.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan membawa Masago bersamaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.61,0:16:29.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang akan Masago katakan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.99,0:16:36.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Andai aku bicara dengan Masago lebih awal.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.83,0:16:40.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.95,0:16:44.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau berencana kabur dengan Masago?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.33,0:16:47.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago mati karenamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.96,0:16:49.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.01,0:16:52.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf aku tidak ada di sisimu
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.63,0:16:55.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,di saat-saat terakhirmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.64,0:17:01.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.31,0:17:06.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tergores pun tidak!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.32,0:17:12.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayakashi ada di dalam energi jahat hitam?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.20,0:17:17.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.16,0:17:19.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,cepat singkirkan mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.42,0:17:31.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka terlalu banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.38,0:17:35.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau membuang-buang waktumu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.93,0:17:38.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayakashi akan terus berdatangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.76,0:17:42.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sementara itu, Kamon akan...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.44,0:17:46.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.90,0:17:49.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunjukkan wujud aslimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.94,0:17:51.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan kehadiranmu terungkap.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.94,0:17:53.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan Lima Gunung Suci membungkuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.24,0:17:56.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan cepat, sesuai perintah hukum.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.70,0:18:00.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Jangan biarkan sumpah tidak terpenuhi.\N- Mao dan Kamon terlalu lama.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.45,0:18:02.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa mereka akan baik-baik saja, Natsuno?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.70,0:18:06.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, kelihatannya tidak bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.83,0:18:08.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong, Nanoka,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.83,0:18:10.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau bisa berenang?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak kuat berenang,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.46,0:18:17.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,jadi aku hanya bisa gaya anjing\Nsekitar 10 meter di kelas renang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.27,0:18:25.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di sini tidak aman. Kita harus pergi!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.56,0:18:26.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.03,0:18:38.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Airnya terbelah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.82,0:18:39.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Luar biasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.96,0:18:47.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yurako?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.42,0:18:50.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.96,0:18:54.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka yang dipanggil ke Goshikido
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,bisa saling melukai dan membunuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.72,0:18:59.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika Shiranui memang mewarisi
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.01,0:19:03.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,takdir Goshikido dari Masago,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.64,0:19:10.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon akan dibunuh oleh Shiranui.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.83,0:19:29.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa... bernapas?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.84,0:19:41.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.90,0:19:55.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.40,0:19:58.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,rambut Masago?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yurako memuntahkan energi jahat hitam!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.62,0:20:11.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat yang sama terhubung\Nke pintu masuk!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.00,0:20:17.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.09,0:20:18.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Air membanjiri aula utama!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.21,0:20:20.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menggunakan serangan Air.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.84,0:20:22.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kini aku mengerti\Nkenapa mereka belum kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.94,0:20:34.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penyihir Tanah?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.23,0:20:40.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu Natsuno?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.99,0:20:44.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rambut...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.59,0:20:59.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa Masago melindunginya?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.71,0:21:02.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau membuatku kesal.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.59,0:21:05.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat aku di sana, aku banyak berpikir.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.72,0:21:09.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau menjadi abadi karena terjebak
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.39,0:21:11.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,dalam lingkaran Goshikido.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bersimpati atas hal itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi mengatakan Masago mati
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,karena pertemuan kita...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.27,0:21:21.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tak berhak mengatakan itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.49,0:21:23.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi aku akan membiarkannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.74,0:21:25.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.33,0:21:34.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang sepertimu
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.71,0:21:38.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,tak berhak memanggil Masago dengan namanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.30,0:21:45.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia marah karena itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.97,0:21:47.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.72,0:21:50.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka, Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.85,0:21:53.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak diragukan lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.73,0:21:56.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini energi jahat hitam yang sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.15,0:21:58.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yurako
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.65,0:21:59.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.40,0:22:01.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Sana?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.11,0:22:05.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satu hal lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.99,0:22:10.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa rambut Masago ada di kuilmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.46,0:22:18.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.46,0:22:22.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pada malam saat Nona Sana mati,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:23.55,0:22:25.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku melihat energi jahat yang sama\Ndi kediaman.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.80,0:22:27.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.22,0:22:30.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat yang sama, dari 900 tahun lalu,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.43,0:22:32.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,saat Nona Sana mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.18,0:22:35.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, aku yakin...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:37.19,0:22:38.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:46.45,0:22:47.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:48.36,0:22:49.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.33,0:22:54.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.54,0:22:58.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:04.05,0:23:05.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Sana...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.76,0:23:08.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.18,0:23:11.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:50.02,0:24:52.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan membawa Masago kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.28,0:24:55.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu mencabut jantung Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:55.62,0:24:56.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jantungnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:56.95,0:25:00.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku melihat jantung merah darah Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.08,0:25:03.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat mencemaskanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:04.08,0:25:05.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau tak bisa mengerti itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:06.00,0:25:07.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:08.09,0:25:10.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah berusaha memikirkan perasaanmu,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:11.01,0:25:13.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi kau bahkan tidak pernah\Nmemperhatikanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:14.59,0:25:16.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya, "Jantung Sana".
